verification_evidence: F:\\HarmonyPC\\hamlib-4.7.2-adapt-20260907\\conan-create-r40.log; F:\\HarmonyPC\\hamlib-4.7.2-adapt-20260907\\ci44952-failure-summary.md
new_increment: CI exposed a missing optional Bash conf that local Windows profile masked; defaulting to the PATH command keeps the test package executable across CI and workstation profiles while preserving explicit configured paths.
applicability_boundary: Applies only to shell-command selection in cross-build test packages; it does not assert target execution, signer readiness, dependency publication, or W3 PASS.
